This guideline provides essential recommendations for the endocrine treatment of individuals experiencing gender dysphoria, reflecting Hannema SE's expertise and contribution to this important area of healthcare.", "MEYER WJ:Meyer WJ is an author of the Endocrine Society Clinical Practice Guideline focused on the endocrine treatment of gender-dysphoric persons. This guideline serves as a comprehensive resource for the clinical management of individuals experiencing gender dysphoria, outlining best practices and recommendations for endocrine treatment.", "CIPROTERONA:Ciproterona is a medication that is primarily used in hormone therapy for transgender individuals, noted for its antiandrogenic effects. It is recommended that Ciproterona be taken with meals to minimize gastrointestinal discomfort.", "HEMATOCRITO:Hematocrit is a measure of the proportion of blood volume that is occupied by red blood cells, important in assessing cardiovascular risk.", "APNEAS DEL SUEÑO:Sleep apnea is a sleep disorder characterized by pauses in breathing or periods of shallow breathing during sleep, often associated with obesity and metabolic syndrome.", "CÁNCER DE ÚTERO:Uterine cancer is a type of cancer that begins in the lining of the uterus, with risk factors that may be influenced by hormonal treatments.", "MAMOGRAFÍA:Mammography is a diagnostic tool used to screen for breast cancer, important for monitoring health in individuals undergoing hormone therapy.", "HISTERECTOMÍA:Hysterectomy is a surgical procedure to remove the uterus, which may be relevant for individuals undergoing gender-affirming surgeries.", "TRATAMIENTO HORMONAL:Hormone therapy refers to the use of hormones in medical treatment, particularly for transgender individuals to align physical characteristics with gender identity.", "CIE-11:The CIE-11, or Clasificación Internacional de Enfermedades (International Classification of Diseases), is the 11th revision of a comprehensive classification system designed to categorize diseases and health conditions. It was presented at the World Health Assembly in May 2019 for adoption by Member States. This classification system includes parameters specifically for the evaluation of nutritional status, highlighting its role in assessing various health aspects beyond just diseases.", "CIE-10:The CIE-10, or Clasificación Internacional de Enfermedades, 10ª revisión, is a comprehensive coding system utilized for the classification of medical diagnoses and procedures. This system plays a crucial role in categorizing diseases and health-related issues, thereby facilitating data collection and clinical management. The CIE-10 is the 10th revision of the International Classification of Diseases and remains in use until the implementation of the CIE-11. Additionally, the CIE-10 provides updated guidelines for the classification of various conditions, including eating disorders, ensuring a standardized approach to health data across different medical contexts.", "TRASTORNO DE LA IDENTIDAD SEXUAL:The Trastorno de la identidad sexual refers to disorders of sexual identity classified in the CIE-10.", "ACETATO DE CIPROTERONA:Acetato de ciproterona is a progestin with anti-androgenic properties commonly used in Europe for transgender women.", "TRATAMIENTOS CON HORMONAS:Hormone treatments are medical procedures that transgender individuals may undergo to align their physical characteristics with their gender identity."], "parameters": {"model": "text-embedding-3-small", "temperature": 0.0, "frequency_penalty": null, "presence_penalty": null, "top_p": 1.0, "max_tokens": 4000, "n": 1}, "history": null}